    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You have learned to use <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> without telltale gestures, reducing the disturbances created in the process. Whenever you make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> you can make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check to convey deceptive appearances in order to conceal the effects of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> use.<br><br>Normal modifiers for the Deception's Complexity still apply.",
